        </div>

        <p>This plan assumes you start from zero. Skip ahead to the appropriate level if you already have a base. Most people do not reach Level 6 in 12 weeks. That level requires additional months of dedicated grip training.</p>
        <p>Detailed week-by-week programs with daily prescriptions are available in the <a href="/training-programs/">training programs section</a>. Choose from <a href="/4-week-program/">4-week</a>, <a href="/8-week-program/">8-week</a> and <a href="/12-week-program/">12-week</a> formats.</p>

